root flow map            | '{a: 1, b: 2}'     -> {'{a': '1, b: 2}'}
root flow map, no space  | '{a:1,b:2}'        -> {'{a': '1,b:2}'}
root flow seq            | '[1, 2, 3]'        -> [1, 2, 3]
root flow map single     | '{a: 1}'           -> {'{a': '1}'}
root flow empty map      | '{}'               -> {}

expected by real YAML semantics: {a: 1, b: 2} -> {'a': 1, 'b': 2}

